---

This mod ships no Valheim assets. Fonts, sprites and item icons are read from
the running game at load time and are not redistributed. Valheim is the
property of Iron Gate Studio; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Iron Gate Studio or Coffee Stain Publishing.

The only images bundled with this mod are the three link icons in `art/`
(a globe, the GitHub mark and the Nexus Mods mark), recoloured from public
domain sources. The GitHub and Nexus Mods marks are trademarks of their
respective owners and are used here only to point at this project's pages on
those sites; no endorsement is implied.
